/* ============================================================================
   NeuroPulse iOS — Localizable.strings (English base)

   Purpose: extracted user-visible strings from the consent flow, session
   regulatory footer, and hardware setup wizard.

   ISCs satisfied: ISC-158 (string extraction), ISC-159 (multi-line notice
   representation), ISC-160 (irreversibility / BIPA text must not be truncated —
   verified at source: no .lineLimit(1) on these views).

   NOTE: Swift source files are NOT yet wired to NSLocalizedString — that is a
   separate, test-gated pass. The corresponding source files carry a
   TODO(localisation) marker. Keys here are the canonical English values and
   must match the current hardcoded source strings verbatim.
   ============================================================================ */


